WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:04.219
-[music]
-Huzzah! All votes have now been cast. The

cue-2
00:00:04.219 --> 00:00:10.819
victor's laurels gained at last. In an old
armchair, aloft, he soars. No candidate

cue-3
00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:16.839
could wish for more. The election's won,
the day is his own. Through all the town,

cue-4
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:22.739
the winner's shown. But careful, sirs, who
bear his weight, lest the member meet a

cue-5
00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:26.819
dreadful fate.
